          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for aromatherapy membership, consultations, and ritual guidance in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#FFF8F3; --bg2:#F4FFF9; --accent:#7AC1A7; --muted:#6B6B6B; --card:#FFFFFF; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --maxw:1100px; --radius:14px; --gap:22px; --accent-dark:#3D8C6C;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));\\n      color:#123; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      line-height:1.45; padding:40px 20px;\\n      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');\\n      background-repeat: repeat; background-size:240px 240px;\\n    }\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto;}\\n\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:26px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{\\n      width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-dark));\\n      display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700; font-size:20px; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(23,40,30,0.08);\\n    }\\n    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:#234; text-decoration:none; padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass)}\\n\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n\\n    /* HERO */\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.8));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(12,12,12,0.05)}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:#0B3F32}\\n    .hero p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:#2d4a40}\\n    .hero .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .pill{background:rgba(122,193,167,0.14);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent-dark);font-weight:600}\\n\\n    /* FORM CARD */\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(12,12,12,0.04)}\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#254};\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],textarea,select{\\n      width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-size:14px;color:#123;background:transparent;resize:vertical\\n    }\\n    textarea{min-height:110px}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    button.primary{background:var(--accent-dark);color:white;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    button.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    /* SIDEBAR */\\n    aside .box{margin-bottom:16px}\\n    .contact-info p{margin:6px 0;color:#234}\\n    .tiny{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* SECTIONS */\\n    section{margin-top:22px}\\n    .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .section-head h3{margin:0;font-size:18px;color:#153d33}\\n    .ritual-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .ritual-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,white,rgba(250,250,250,0.92));padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0}\\n    .what p{margin:10px 0;color:#2d4a40}\\n\\n    .schedule-list{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .schedule-item{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(122,193,167,0.06),rgba(122,193,167,0.02));border:1px solid rgba(122,193,167,0.09)}\\n\\n    .pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}\\n    .price{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:white;border:1px solid #efe; text-align:center}\\n    .price h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr} .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} .ritual-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} .price{padding:14px}}\\n    @media (max-width:560px){.pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} nav{display:none} header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">A</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Shop</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div>\\n        <!-- HERO -->\\n        <section class=\\\"hero card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"pill\\\">Membership</span><span>Warm, consultative aromatherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></div>\\n          <h2>Let’s craft a scent ritual that fits your life.</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Reach out to schedule a welcome conversation, ask about blends, or join the membership for monthly rituals and refill savings. I make safety and clarity a priority — no medical promises, just thoughtful, plant-forward support.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a visit</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- RITUAL -->\\n        <section aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual\\\" class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"ritual\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>Rituals &amp; ways to meet</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">gentle, sensory guidance</small></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ritual-grid\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"ritual-card\\\">\\n              <strong>Welcome Consultation</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">30–45 minutes. We'll talk scent history, sensitivities, and goals. You'll leave with a simple ritual to try.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ritual-card\\\">\\n              <strong>Membership Ritual Box</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Monthly curated blends and notes, exclusive meditations, and refills at a member rate.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ritual-card\\\">\\n              <strong>Workshop: At-home Rituals</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Group sessions to learn safe dilution, patch testing, and blending basics — a hands-on, supportive space.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ritual-card\\\">\\n              <strong>Virtual Check-in</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">20-minute touchpoint to refine a blend or adapt a ritual for life changes.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"what-to-expect\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>What to expect in your first conversation</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">a safety-forward, sensory-first experience</small></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"what\\\">\\n            <p>I begin by listening: your scent memories, current routines, and any safety notes (allergies, pregnancy, pets). Then we explore a handful of essential oils and pre-blended options at low dilution so you can sense what resonates. You’ll leave with a doable at-home ritual and clear instructions for safe use.</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">I do not diagnose or treat medical conditions. Aromatherapy is complementary; please consult your healthcare provider for medical concerns.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- SCHEDULE -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"schedule\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>Availability &amp; booking</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">book a welcome or a workshop</small></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"schedule-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"schedule-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Welcome Consult — 9:30am &amp; 2:30pm</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays — 45 min</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"schedule-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Member Drop-in — 1st Saturday</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">30 min check-ins for members</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"schedule-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Workshops — Monthly</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">Evenings, limited spots</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"schedule-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Virtual slots</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">Weekday mornings — 20 min touchpoint</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Reserve a spot</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- PRICING -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"pricing\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>Pricing &amp; membership</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">clear, predictable support</small></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pricing-grid\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n              <h4>Essentials</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">One welcome consult + starter blend</div>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:10px 0;font-weight:700\\\">$85</p>\\n              <button class=\\\"secondary\\\">Book Essentials</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n              <h4>Membership</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">Monthly ritual box + 10% refills</div>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:10px 0;font-weight:700\\\">$28 / mo</p>\\n              <button class=\\\"primary\\\">Join Membership</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n              <h4>Workshop</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">Hands-on group learning</div>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:10px 0;font-weight:700\\\">$40</p>\\n              <button class=\\\"secondary\\\">See schedule</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Membership perks include priority booking, member-only blends, and a gentle refill program.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- FAQ -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>FAQ</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">safety &amp; simple guidance</small></div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n            <strong>How do you dilute essential oils?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">I recommend starting with low dilutions (0.5–3% for most adults) depending on application. Specific percentages are provided with each blend so you can replicate the ritual safely at home.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Should I patch test?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Yes. I guide you through a simple patch test on the inner forearm before suggesting full use. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult your healthcare provider.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n            <strong>What about pets?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Some essential oils can be irritating to pets. I’ll review your household (cats, dogs, other animals) and suggest pet-safe options and diffusion practices to reduce exposure.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Pregnancy &amp; breastfeeding</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">If you are pregnant or breastfeeding we take extra precautions. Some oils are avoided or used only with medical approval; I always advise consulting your care provider alongside our conversation.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- CTA -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"final-cta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"section-head\\\"><h3>Ready to begin?</h3><small class=\\\"tiny\\\">an invitation, not a prescription</small></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">See available times</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <!-- CONTACT FORM -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Get in touch</h3>\\n          <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"alert('Thank you — form submission is a demo.');return false;\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"First &amp; last\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"reason\\\">I am contacting about</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n              <option>Membership</option>\\n              <option>Welcome consultation</option>\\n              <option>Workshop</option>\\n              <option>Wholesale / shop</option>\\n              <option>Other</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me a little about your scent history, any sensitivities, and what you hope for.\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n              <input id=\\\"consent\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\" required />\\n              <label for=\\\"consent\\\" class=\\\"tiny\\\">I agree to be contacted about services. I understand aromatherapy is supportive and not a medical treatment.</label>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email directly</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p class=\\\"tiny\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Prefer to call? <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>. Office hours are Tues–Sat, mornings and early afternoons.</p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- CONTACT DETAILS -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card contact-info box\\\">\\n          <h4>Contact &amp; studio</h4>\\n          <p>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- QUICK NOTE -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card box\\\">\\n          <h4>Safety-first note</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"tiny\\\">Blends are selected for aroma, skin safety, and household context. I never make medical claims — if you have a health concern, please consult your healthcare provider before using aromatic products.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>&copy; <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Crafted with care. Favorite blend: {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# aromatherapy-2026-02-16T18-50-41-132Z-048\\n\\nThis chunk contains the contact page and a README for the Aura Editorial aromatherapy site.\\n\\nFiles included in this bundle:\\n\\n- contact.html — a full, responsive contact & info page tailored for an aromatherapy practitioner membership site. It contains these required sections: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, cta as requested.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace before publishing:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}\\n\\nNotes and guidance:\\n- The page references an SVG background at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure that file is provided in the final project (unique pattern required).\\n- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used; visual richness is driven by CSS gradients, shadows, and the SVG pattern.\\n- The voice is warm-storyteller and membership-focused; copy emphasizes safety (no medical claims).\\n- The contact form is a demo (onsubmit handler prevents actual submission). Replace with your form handler or integration.\\n- FAQ includes dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy notes to meet aromatherapy safety expectations.\\n\\nAccessibility & Progressive Enhancement:\\n- Semantic headings and form labels are included.\\n- The layout collapses to a single column on small screens.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Replace placeholders with your real content.\\n2. Add assets/img/pattern.svg (unique SVG) and any other assets.\\n3. Hook the contact form to your backend or a third-party form provider.\\n4. Copy contact.html to your site root or wire into your build.\\n\\nLicense: This chunk is provided as-is for your site; adapt copy for local regulations and client needs.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
